    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "The astrological symbol of the dwarf planet Makemake invented by Henry Seltzer and used in his programs TimePassages and AstroGraph. See <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.astrograph.com/images/icons/makemake.jpg\">[1]</a> Not to be confused with the old astronomical symbol for 8 Flora, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flora_symbol_(simple,_fixed_width).svg\" title=\"File:Flora symbol (simple, fixed width).svg\">Flora symbol (simple, fixed width).svg</a>: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flora_symbol_(simple,_fixed_width).svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Flora_symbol_%28simple%2C_fixed_width%29.svg/40px-Flora_symbol_%28simple%2C_fixed_width%29.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Flora_symbol_%28simple%2C_fixed_width%29.svg/60px-Flora_symbol_%28simple%2C_fixed_width%29.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"16\" data-file-height=\"16\"></a></span>.",
